# release.go:106 was `return -ln(1 - rng.Uniform())`: inlined, Uniform's
# division by 2^52 is a multiplication that arm64, riscv64 and loong64 fused
# with `1 - U`. Fixed with `1 - float64(rng.Uniform())` (an explicit
# conversion rounds, so no fusion); on amd64 v1, where the vectors and the
# Python reference run, the value is unchanged (TestReleaseRunVectors still
# passes bit for bit). After the fix every target PASSes (backend-numeric.log).
